sequenceDiagram
autonumber
actor System as System
participant UploadAPI as Boundary: UploadAPI
participant ImageValidationControl as Control: ImageValidationControl
participant ImageFile as Entity: ImageFile
System->>UploadAPI: Receive candidate upload
UploadAPI->>ImageValidationControl: Validate bytes, MIME, decode and pixels
ImageValidationControl->>ImageFile: Create trusted image metadata
ImageFile-->>ImageValidationControl: Return UUID and digest identity
ImageValidationControl-->>UploadAPI: Encrypt and persist validated bytes
UploadAPI-->>System: Return safe upload result
